-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  prj_pack_err_toml.pcpp - Projects: pcpp pack on an invalid project.toml

  The fixture's project.toml is not TOML: its PJ0001 report and exit 1, as
  pcpp build gives, and nothing is built or packed. A cli test (pcpp
  itself, in the suite's output root); this file itself is never compiled.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe prj_pack_err_toml;

/*
  @@test
    kind cli
    args "--no-banner pack <DIR>/fixtures/bad_parse"
    exitcode 1
    expect
    | [ERROR] PJ0001: Cannot read the project file '<DIR>/fixtures/bad_parse/project.toml': Failed to parse TOML: Expected ']' at line 4, column 9
    | Failed.
  @@end
*/

begin
end.
